  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Mirce">Mirc.</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðonne bið cynges anfeald wergild six þegna wer be Myrcna laga, þæt is XXX þusend sceatta, 7 þæt bið ealles CXX punda.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Then a king's simple wergild is is the wergild of six thegns by the law of the Mercians, namely 30,000 sceattas, which is 120 pounds in all.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðonne byð cyninges anfeald wergild syx þegena wergyld be Myrcna lage, þæt is XXX þusend sceatta, þæt bið ealles CXX punda.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">According to the law of the Mercians, then, the king's individual wergild is the wergild of six thegns, that is, thirty thousand sceattas, which is one hundred and twenty pounds in all.</ab>
      </div>
